{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\n# About This Lab\n**Objective:** Become familiar with Spark complex types operations\n**File locations:**\n**Successful outcome:**\n**Before you begin:**\n**Related lessons:** Working with DataFrames\n\nCopyright © 2010–2021 Cloudera. All rights reserved.\nNot to be reproduced or shared without prior written consent from Cloudera.\n\n---","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:19-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","editorHide":true,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874975_1633296413","id":"20171105-200834_1116095891","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:19-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:19-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"focus":true,"$$hashKey":"object:1727"},{"text":"%md\n## Overview\n\nIn this module we consider the complex collection data types provided bySpark SQL: arrays, maps, and structs.\nWe show how to construct and transform columns with complex collection data types.\n\n\n## Complex Collection Data Types\n\n* Complex collection data types provide a way to renormalize the denormalized data that is common in the big-data world\n\n* The complex collection data types are defined in the `pyspark.sql.types` module:\n    * The *ArrayType* represents a variable-length collection of elements\n    * The *MapType* represents a variable-length collection of key-value pairs\n    * The *StructType* represents a fixed-length collection of named elements\n\n* Complex collection data types are obtained in several ways:\n    * Inherited from Hive/Impala tables\n    * Inferred from nested JSON files\n    * Generated by aggregate functions such as `collect_list` and `collect_set`\n    * Constructed manually","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:19-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874977_458386699","id":"20210609-214236_1622006817","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:19-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:19-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1728"},{"text":"%md\n# Setup\n---","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:19-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874977_1039980702","id":"20181114-164229_902436001","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:20-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:20-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1729"},{"title":"Read the raw data from HDFS","text":"%spark\n\nval rides = spark.read.option(\"header\",\"true\").option(\"inferShema\",\"true\").csv(\"/duocar/raw/rides/\")\nval drivers = spark.read.option(\"header\",\"true\").option(\"inferShema\",\"true\").csv(\"/duocar/raw/drivers/\")\nval riders = spark.read.option(\"header\",\"true\").option(\"inferShema\",\"true\").csv(\"/duocar/raw/riders/\")","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:20-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874978_1492385901","id":"20210609-214604_1208392134","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:20-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:22-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1730"},{"text":"%md\n# Lesson\n---","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:22-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874979_305317615","id":"20210609-150445_381117564","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:22-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:22-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1731"},{"text":"%md\n## Arrays","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:22-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874979_212410897","id":"20210609-214808_2124581014","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:22-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:22-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1732"},{"title":"Use the array function to create an array from multiple columns","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{array}\nval drivers_array = (drivers.withColumn(\"vehicle_array\", array(\"vehicle_make\", \"vehicle_model\"))\n                            .select(\"vehicle_make\", \"vehicle_model\", \"vehicle_array\"))\ndrivers_array.printSchema()\ndrivers_array.show(5, false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:22-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874980_506804755","id":"20210609-214950_490436151","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:22-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:25-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1733"},{"title":"Use index notation to access elements of the array","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{col}\n\ndrivers_array.select($\"vehicle_array\", col(\"vehicle_array\").getItem(0)).show(5, false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:25-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874980_1425925529","id":"20210609-215139_462878767","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:25-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:27-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1734"},{"title":"Use the size function to get the length of the array","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{size}\n\ndrivers_array.select($\"vehicle_array\", size($\"vehicle_array\")).show(5, false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:27-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874981_-1841866144","id":"20210609-215230_879633660","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:27-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:28-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1735"},{"title":"Use the sort_array function to sort the array","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{sort_array}\n\ndrivers_array.select($\"vehicle_array\", sort_array($\"vehicle_array\", true)).show(5, false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:28-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874981_-1830738018","id":"20210609-215326_1600236400","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:28-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:30-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1736"},{"title":"Use the `array_contains` function to search the array","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{array_contains}\n\ndrivers_array.select($\"vehicle_array\", array_contains($\"vehicle_array\", \"Subaru\")).show(5, false)\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:30-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874982_1697853249","id":"20210609-215508_1658632882","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:30-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:32-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1737"},{"title":"Use the `explode` and `posexplode` functions to explode the array","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{explode, posexplode}\n\ndrivers_array.select($\"vehicle_array\", explode($\"vehicle_array\")).show(5,false)\ndrivers_array.select($\"vehicle_array\", posexplode($\"vehicle_array\")).show(5,false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:32-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874983_-417665259","id":"20210609-215631_592611552","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:32-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:34-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1738"},{"text":"%md\n## Maps","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:34-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874983_1781804725","id":"20210609-214825_941697596","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:34-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:34-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1739"},{"title":"Use the create_map function to create a map","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{lit, map}\n\n// `lit` (short for \"literal\") allows map keys to be created from a constant or static value (the 'make' and 'model' keys).\n\nval drivers_map = (drivers \n  .withColumn(\"vehicle_map\", map(lit(\"make\"), $\"vehicle_make\", lit(\"model\"), $\"vehicle_model\"))\n  .select(\"vehicle_make\", \"vehicle_model\", \"vehicle_map\"))\ndrivers_map.printSchema()\ndrivers_map.show(5, false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:34-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874984_-793736570","id":"20210609-215809_1949067261","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:34-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:36-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1740"},{"title":"Use getItem to access a value by position","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{lit, map_values}\n\ndrivers_map.select($\"vehicle_map\", map_values(col(\"vehicle_map\")).getItem(0)).show(5, false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:36-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874985_-218262233","id":"20210609-215929_1972517761","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:36-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:38-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1741"},{"title":"Use the `size` function to get the length of the map","text":"%spark\n\ndrivers_map.select($\"vehicle_map\", size($\"vehicle_map\")).show(5, false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:38-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874986_1324171570","id":"20210609-220011_2145852577","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:39-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:40-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1742"},{"title":"Use the `explode` and `posexplode` functions to explode the map","text":"%spark\n\ndrivers_map.select($\"vehicle_map\", explode($\"vehicle_map\")).show(5, false)\ndrivers_map.select($\"vehicle_map\", posexplode($\"vehicle_map\")).show(5, false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:40-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874986_-1746466446","id":"20210609-220050_526377266","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:40-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:42-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1743"},{"text":"%md\n## Structs","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:42-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874987_-1228845080","id":"20210609-214847_1367988366","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:42-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:42-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1744"},{"title":"Use the struct function to create a struct","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{struct}\n\nval drivers_struct = (drivers \n  .withColumn(\"vehicle_struct\", struct(col(\"vehicle_make\").alias(\"make\"), col(\"vehicle_model\").alias(\"model\")))\n  .select(\"vehicle_make\", \"vehicle_model\", \"vehicle_struct\"))\ndrivers_struct.printSchema()\ndrivers_struct.show(5, false)\ndrivers_struct.head(5)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:42-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874987_-158751414","id":"20210609-220250_300408590","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:42-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:44-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1745"},{"title":"Note","text":"%md\nThe struct is a `Row` object (embedded in a `Row` object).","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:44-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874988_-636279983","id":"20210609-220428_2046707505","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:45-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:45-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1746"},{"title":"Use dot notation to access struct elements","text":"%spark\n\n(drivers_struct\n  .select(\"vehicle_struct\", \"vehicle_struct.make\")\n  .show(5, false))","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:45-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874989_404883492","id":"20210625-140807_1147580554","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:45-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:46-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1747"},{"title":"Use the `to_json` function to convert the struct to a JSON string","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{to_json}\n\ndrivers_struct.select($\"vehicle_struct\", to_json($\"vehicle_struct\")).show(5, false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:46-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874989_1877764532","id":"20210609-220533_1798862611","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:46-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:47-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1748"},{"text":"%md\n# Lab\n---","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:47-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874990_1832577465","id":"20210609-150527_79851234","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:47-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:47-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1749"},{"title":"1 - Create an array called `home_array` that includes the driver's home latitude and longitude","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{array}\n\nval drivers_array = drivers.withColumn(\"home_array\", array(\"home_lat\", \"home_lon\"))\ndrivers_array.select(\"home_lat\", \"home_lon\", \"home_array\").show(5, false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:47-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874992_-1921576860","id":"20210609-221114_987659308","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:47-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:50-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1750"},{"title":"2 - Create a map called `name_map` that includes the driver's first and last name","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{lit, map}\n\nval drivers_map = drivers.withColumn(\"name_map\", map(lit(\"first\"), $\"first_name\", lit(\"last\"), $\"last_name\"))\ndrivers_map.select(\"first_name\", \"last_name\", \"name_map\").show(5, false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:50-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874993_135808082","id":"20210609-221146_1508826613","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:50-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:52-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1751"},{"title":"3 - Create a struct called `name_struct` that includes the driver's first # and last name","text":"%spark\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{col, struct}\nval drivers_struct = drivers.withColumn(\"name_struct\", struct(col(\"first_name\").alias(\"first\"), col(\"last_name\").alias(\"last\")))\n\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions.{to_json}\ndrivers_struct.select($\"first_name\", $\"last_name\", $\"name_struct\", to_json($\"name_struct\")).show(5, false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:52-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/scala","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874996_-612724826","id":"20210609-221144_10985682","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:52-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:54-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1752"},{"text":"%md\n# Result\n**You have now:** become familiar with Spark complex types operations\n\n---","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:34:54-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946874997_-1446998390","id":"20181119-142716_792318228","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:14-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:34:54-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:34:54-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKe